  <data name="About_Changes" xml:space="preserve">
    <value># 1.18.16
instant Metro search across servers, direct messages, and friends in both the Start and Friends hubs
add friend by username, join servers via invite link (discord.gg/...), accept/decline requests directly in the Pending tab, and manage friendship right from any profile card
fixed crashes in both server text channels and direct messages (ArgumentException on null icon/badge URLs)
# 1.18.15
fixed UI crash (ArgumentException) when opening direct message chats with null/missing badge or icon URLs
fixed stickers and images not loading in Metro chat bubbles (removed x:Load + x:Phase conflict, fixed StickerControl template timing &amp; GIF stickers, guarded zero-dimension image URLs)
handled newer Discord message types (e.g. type 67) cleanly instead of showing "Unknown system message type 67!"
# 1.18.14
fixed DM voice call tiles so participants appear when they join and disappear when they leave (with Gateway OP 13 CALL_CONNECT subscription, join/leave chimes, and a live "waiting for recipient…" / participant count header)
fixed the first opened conversation's avatar sticking across subsequent chats
# 1.18.13
in-app GitHub Releases updater &amp; version sync: automatic update indicator on the start hub tile, live release notes sync, and architecture-matched (.appx) download on the "about" page
# 1.18.12
voice calls in direct messages (1-on-1 DMs and group DMs): Call button in DM chat headers and Metro profile cards, outgoing ring, DAVE E2EE voice, and active call tile on the start hub
# 1.18.11
unified Windows Phone Metro speech bubbles across server text channels and direct messages (with square avatars, role colours, server tags, and profile tap)
# 1.18.10
support tile now opens the Lyracord Telegram community (t.me/lyracord)
fixed pressing Back on the profile overlay from the start hub exiting the app instead of closing the profile
# 1.18.9
new sharp geometric Metro "L" app logo across all tiles, splash screens, and Rich Presence (built-in Lyracord App ID)
profile card redesigned in pure Windows Phone Metro style (full-bleed AMOLED, square avatar with status bar, Metro light typography, square server icons)
all 7 settings sections unified in Metro style (no WinUI NavigationView chrome) and Notifications settings unlocked and fixed
# 1.18.8
Rich Presence: optional "Lyracord · Windows 10 Mobile" status in Discord (toggle in Metro settings)
server page: added a third "members" tab next to channels and voice (online/roles/offline, server tags, tap to open profile)
# 1.18.7
profile card now scrolls smoothly on phone screens with a close button and clear bottom margin
profile shows live activity (games, Spotify, streams), recently played games (content-inventory), profile game widgets, and connected accounts
# 1.18.6
server tags (primary_guild) in Metro square style: badge icon and tag next to usernames in chat, profiles, start hub, friends, direct messages, and voice
# 1.18.5
sign-in screen and token dialog raised well clear of the Windows navigation bar
language selector added before sign-in and in Metro settings (English, Russian, Ukrainian, System)
# 1.18.4
desktop voice service reconnect parity (handles server changes and disconnects)
updated documentation and cleaned up unused files
# 1.18.3
fixed deafen (mute sound): turning sound off and back on works reliably without breaking playback
mic mute and deafen buttons added to the stream player bar
image cache size limit (50 MB) and clear-cache item in settings
buffered and size-capped stream/voice logs, lighter diagnostic report
# 1.18.2
audio output switch during calls (speaker, earpiece, headset, Bluetooth) and headset hot-plug handling
voice reconnect counter resets after a stable connection
fixed settings migration overwriting local settings on launch
smoother stream closing, clear message for unsupported video codecs, DM voice safety
# 1.18.1
fixed crash and freeze when ending a voice call
voice calls keep running when the screen is locked
# 1.18.0
English and Ukrainian interface
# 1.17.4
publisher shown on install: lambdawesta
# 1.17.3
sign-in dialog buttons no longer hide behind the navigation bar
after a wrong token: back to sign-in, not an empty friends page
# 1.17.2
a wrong or expired token: a clear message and back to sign-in instead of endless connecting
captcha on the phone: an explanation instead of a crash
# 1.17.1
the token is no longer stored as plain text in the app settings
# 1.17.0
own package name and certificate (installs as a new app)
step-by-step token instructions instead of a placeholder link
# 1.16.2
Lyracord presents itself as the current Discord build: new profile badges
the build number can be changed: settings → client build
# 1.16.0
Windows Phone animations: pages fly in as a turnstile, tiles and lists as a feather
# 1.15.x
faster start: fast parsing of channels, roles and permissions, no extra requests before connecting
avatars cached on the phone, full-screen stream in landscape</value>
